1
00:01:28,201 --> 00:01:33,352
[Adapted from Che Ye Liu Xiang's
novel of the same name]

2
00:01:33,352 --> 00:01:34,500
[Episode 10]

3
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,167
I know what kind of information
Bei Lv Qing received

4
00:01:36,167 --> 00:01:38,333
to make such a big move.

5
00:01:47,625 --> 00:01:49,666
Why are you always watching him?

6
00:01:49,666 --> 00:01:51,916
Can't you do something else?

7
00:01:51,916 --> 00:01:53,875
We're about to join the WTO.

8
00:01:53,875 --> 00:01:56,926
Bei Lv Qing and his people must have
gotten the news a long time ago.

9
00:01:59,750 --> 00:02:03,208
WTO, the World Trade Organization.

10
00:02:03,208 --> 00:02:04,958
Next month, the Ministry
of Agriculture will open up

11
00:02:04,958 --> 00:02:08,366
import permits for agricultural products
as a token of sincerity.

12
00:02:10,041 --> 00:02:12,000
- And so?
- What do you mean?

13
00:02:13,083 --> 00:02:14,833
Whichever product is opened for import,

14
00:02:14,833 --> 00:02:17,458
its price in the futures market will plummet.

15
00:02:17,458 --> 00:02:21,916
As long as we know which product it is,

16
00:02:21,916 --> 00:02:23,791
we'll short it.

17
00:02:23,791 --> 00:02:26,208
Shorting 100,000 can easily make us a million.

18
00:02:26,208 --> 00:02:30,045
If we're lucky,
we could make millions, Xiao Fan.

19
00:02:32,833 --> 00:02:35,416
I didn't expect you to get any info.

20
00:02:35,416 --> 00:02:37,666
I'll get the information myself.

21
00:02:37,666 --> 00:02:41,208
But I'm guessing this agricultural product...

22
00:02:41,208 --> 00:02:43,250
will likely be corn.

23
00:02:43,250 --> 00:02:45,666
Lv Qing has been paying special attention
to corn orders lately.

24
00:02:45,666 --> 00:02:47,708
He's made several trades.

25
00:02:47,708 --> 00:02:49,416
None of them were big,

26
00:02:49,416 --> 00:02:53,333
but the timing was strange,
as if he's testing the waters.

27
00:02:54,083 --> 00:02:56,750
Corn in the market
has gone up to 50 cents a pound.

28
00:02:56,750 --> 00:02:59,083
I heard from a corn farmer

29
00:02:59,083 --> 00:03:00,833
that fewer people grew corn this year.

30
00:03:00,833 --> 00:03:03,458
There will definitely be a shortage next year.

31
00:03:03,458 --> 00:03:04,916
How can the futures price fall?

32
00:03:04,916 --> 00:03:06,291
What do you know?

33
00:03:06,291 --> 00:03:07,958
Do you think securities
are like your grocery basket?

34
00:03:07,958 --> 00:03:09,291
It's about politics.

35
00:03:09,291 --> 00:03:11,250
It's about the economy.

36
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:13,500
Once the news of the opening is out,

37
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:14,583
regardless of whether there's a shortage,

38
00:03:14,583 --> 00:03:16,625
the futures price will definitely fall.

39
00:03:16,625 --> 00:03:18,500
This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

40
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:22,083
I'm just 100,000 yuan short
of setting up the account.

41
00:03:22,083 --> 00:03:24,000
But...

42
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,291
I don't even have 100,000 yuan.

43
00:03:26,291 --> 00:03:28,083
What?

44
00:03:28,083 --> 00:03:29,375
No way.

45
00:03:29,375 --> 00:03:32,333
You've been with the Beis for years,
and you don't even have 100,000?

46
00:03:32,333 --> 00:03:34,125
Are you kidding me?

47
00:03:34,125 --> 00:03:36,041
The Beis provide everything for you.

48
00:03:36,041 --> 00:03:37,458
The Beis give you pocket money all the time.

49
00:03:37,458 --> 00:03:38,958
It must be more than 100,000 yuan.

50
00:03:38,958 --> 00:03:40,978
You haven't saved any of it?

51
00:03:42,833 --> 00:03:44,125
Xiao Fan.

52
00:03:44,125 --> 00:03:45,708
I know you're stingy.

53
00:03:45,708 --> 00:03:48,500
But it's not like I won't pay you back.

54
00:03:48,500 --> 00:03:49,625
How about this?

55
00:03:49,625 --> 00:03:51,041
We'll split the profit 60-40.

56
00:03:51,041 --> 00:03:52,041
I'll take 60, you take 40.

57
00:03:52,041 --> 00:03:53,375
Let's get rich together, brother.

58
00:03:53,375 --> 00:03:55,036
I really don't have it.

59
00:03:56,916 --> 00:03:58,000
Xiao Fan.

60
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:00,042
Are you trying to stop your brother
from making a fortune?

61
00:04:00,042 --> 00:04:02,037
I really don't have any money.

62
00:04:03,458 --> 00:04:06,518
I don't know if you have a grudge
against me or against money.

63
00:04:20,833 --> 00:04:22,083
Big Bro.

64
00:04:22,083 --> 00:04:23,541
I need to tell you something.

65
00:04:23,541 --> 00:04:25,791
<i>What is it? Is it serious?</i>

66
00:04:25,791 --> 00:04:28,704
You should be careful of my brother lately.

67
00:04:28,704 --> 00:04:30,125
I feel like he...

68
00:04:30,125 --> 00:04:32,583
I'm very busy these days.
I might not come home.

69
00:04:32,583 --> 00:04:34,541
Just stay there and don't worry.

70
00:04:49,916 --> 00:04:50,917
<i>Xiao Fan.</i>

71
00:04:50,917 --> 00:04:53,416
<i>Are you slow in the head
or just missing a wire?</i>

72
00:04:53,416 --> 00:04:55,666
<i>We all know you're a bit of a blockhead.</i>

73
00:04:55,666 --> 00:04:58,666
<i>But now your brother wants to make you rich,</i>

74
00:04:58,666 --> 00:05:00,125
<i>and you're still unwilling?</i>

75
00:05:00,125 --> 00:05:02,083
<i>What on earth is wrong with you?</i>

76
00:05:02,083 --> 00:05:04,916
<i>Afraid your brother won't pay you back?</i>

77
00:05:04,916 --> 00:05:07,333
<i>Now your father is swallowing his pride</i>

78
00:05:07,333 --> 00:05:08,960
<i>to ask you for a loan. Is that okay?</i>

79
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:10,810
Dad, I don't have any money.

80
00:05:10,810 --> 00:05:12,875
<i>You... You stubborn child!</i>

81
00:05:12,875 --> 00:05:14,375
<i>Old lady, come here.</i>

82
00:05:14,375 --> 00:05:17,208
<i>Ask Xiao Fan what he's thinking.</i>

83
00:05:17,208 --> 00:05:20,083
<i>Does he not want to
come back to this family anymore?</i>

84
00:05:20,083 --> 00:05:22,458
<i>His brother isn't just borrowing money.</i>

85
00:05:22,458 --> 00:05:24,125
<i>He's trying to make him rich!</i>

86
00:05:24,125 --> 00:05:26,176
<i>Xiao Ping said if this works out,</i>

87
00:05:26,176 --> 00:05:29,096
<i>he'll be the first millionaire in our village.</i>

88
00:05:29,096 --> 00:05:30,250
<i>Don't ask Xiao Fan for money.</i>

89
00:05:30,250 --> 00:05:32,083
<i>Xiao Ping is just being impulsive.</i>

90
00:05:32,083 --> 00:05:33,541
<i>And you're being just as foolish.</i>

91
00:05:33,541 --> 00:05:36,124
<i>If he can just keep a job
that pays 10,000 a month,</i>

92
00:05:36,124 --> 00:05:37,916
<i>the Lu family should be grateful enough.</i>

93
00:05:37,916 --> 00:05:40,124
<i>A million? Don't let
your ambition crush your heart.</i>

94
00:05:40,124 --> 00:05:42,166
<i>His schemes are bigger than a millstone.</i>

95
00:05:42,166 --> 00:05:44,083
<i>Enough. Stop making things
difficult for Xiao Fan.</i>

96
00:05:44,083 --> 00:05:45,458
<i>Let him focus on his work.</i>

97
00:05:45,458 --> 00:05:48,500
<i>Xiao Fan, you should go
talk some sense into your brother.</i>

98
00:05:48,500 --> 00:05:51,301
<i>Make sure he stops getting these crooked ideas.</i>

99
00:05:51,301 --> 00:05:52,426
Sure.

100
00:06:02,542 --> 00:06:03,996
Lu Xiao Ping.

101
00:06:03,996 --> 00:06:06,208
- What exactly are you up to?
- Stop shouting here.

102
00:06:06,208 --> 00:06:09,083
I don't need your money or your help right now.

103
00:06:09,083 --> 00:06:11,145
What I do is none of your business.

104
00:06:11,145 --> 00:06:12,542
Mom told me everything.

105
00:06:12,542 --> 00:06:14,875
This is the villagers' hard-earned money.

106
00:06:14,875 --> 00:06:16,708
So, you know it's hard-earned money.

107
00:06:16,708 --> 00:06:17,541
So many people in our village

108
00:06:17,541 --> 00:06:19,292
worked hard their whole lives
to save that little bit of money.

109
00:06:19,292 --> 00:06:21,625
What's wrong with me
leading everyone to wealth?

110
00:06:21,625 --> 00:06:24,292
Is Bei Lv Qing the only one
allowed to make money?

111
00:06:24,292 --> 00:06:25,778
Fine.

112
00:06:25,778 --> 00:06:27,057
I don't want to talk nonsense with you.

113
00:06:27,057 --> 00:06:28,390
Go back to your overtime.

114
00:06:29,041 --> 00:06:30,250
You...

115
00:06:33,811 --> 00:06:35,975
[Langjian Securities]

116
00:06:43,625 --> 00:06:44,875
Xiao Fan.

117
00:06:44,875 --> 00:06:46,541
What a coincidence.

118
00:06:46,541 --> 00:06:48,207
Wen Xi.

119
00:06:48,207 --> 00:06:49,666
It really is.

120
00:06:49,666 --> 00:06:51,458
You...

121
00:06:51,458 --> 00:06:55,041
Wen Xi, this is...

122
00:06:55,041 --> 00:06:56,499
This is...

123
00:06:56,499 --> 00:06:58,291
This is your fiancé's...

124
00:06:58,291 --> 00:07:01,125
Bei Lv Qing's brother-in-law.

125
00:07:01,125 --> 00:07:03,528
Wen Xi, you're talking nonsense again.

126
00:07:05,708 --> 00:07:07,670
Hello, I'm Song Qian Yu.

127
00:07:07,670 --> 00:07:08,792
I'm from Hong Kong.

128
00:07:08,792 --> 00:07:10,249
Nice to meet you.

129
00:07:10,249 --> 00:07:13,332
Hello. I'm Bei Lv Qing's...

130
00:07:13,332 --> 00:07:14,369
brother-in-law.

131
00:07:14,369 --> 00:07:16,124
Lu Xiao Fan.

132
00:07:16,124 --> 00:07:17,916
Qian Yu, why don't you head back first?

133
00:07:17,916 --> 00:07:20,791
I'm afraid your mother-in-law
is waiting for you.

134
00:07:20,791 --> 00:07:22,833
I'm going to get a drink.
I'm waiting for someone.

135
00:07:22,833 --> 00:07:25,208
Wen Xi, you love teasing people.

136
00:07:25,208 --> 00:07:27,296
I'll be going then. Bye, Xiao Fan.

137
00:07:27,296 --> 00:07:28,575
Bye.

138
00:07:29,708 --> 00:07:30,708
Xiao Fan.

139
00:07:30,708 --> 00:07:33,333
Do you have time? Let's have a drink together.

140
00:07:33,333 --> 00:07:34,540
I'm meeting someone.

141
00:07:34,540 --> 00:07:38,290
But I think it'd be better if you joined me.

142
00:07:44,125 --> 00:07:47,375
Hi, I'll have an ice drip coffee.

143
00:07:47,375 --> 00:07:49,125
Xiao Fan, how about you?

144
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:52,576
You're still having the cappuccino?

145
00:07:54,693 --> 00:07:56,667
A cappuccino, please.

146
00:07:56,667 --> 00:07:58,171
Thank you.

147
00:08:03,291 --> 00:08:05,125
Actually, Bei Lv Qing and I...

148
00:08:05,125 --> 00:08:07,083
We broke up a long time ago.

149
00:08:07,083 --> 00:08:11,145
We had been together since we were sixteen.

150
00:08:11,145 --> 00:08:15,708
But then, his mother, Shen Wu Bei, found out.

151
00:08:15,708 --> 00:08:17,750
She said we had to break up,

152
00:08:17,750 --> 00:08:20,583
or she would tell my father.

153
00:08:20,583 --> 00:08:22,791
Even though I'm the eldest son,

154
00:08:22,791 --> 00:08:25,083
my father is quite a philanderer.

155
00:08:25,083 --> 00:08:28,166
So, I have many younger brothers.

156
00:08:28,166 --> 00:08:31,458
In the end, we chose to part ways.

157
00:08:33,792 --> 00:08:35,958
Don't hold a grudge against me for it.

158
00:08:36,878 --> 00:08:38,625
Bei Lv Qing didn't want you anymore.

159
00:08:38,625 --> 00:08:41,666
He just used me to burn your bridges.

160
00:08:42,416 --> 00:08:44,153
Okay, thank you.

161
00:08:46,543 --> 00:08:49,083
Wen Xi, why are you telling me this?

162
00:08:49,083 --> 00:08:50,558
Is it because...

163
00:08:53,625 --> 00:08:58,791
The love lives of people like us
are more like a game.

164
00:08:58,791 --> 00:09:01,416
During game time, it's just a game.

165
00:09:01,416 --> 00:09:04,959
But real life is reality.

166
00:09:06,083 --> 00:09:09,083
When I got engaged before,
Lv Qing was very unhappy.

167
00:09:09,083 --> 00:09:11,166
Now he's engaged himself.

168
00:09:12,291 --> 00:09:16,541
Xiao Fan, you're not like us.

169
00:09:16,541 --> 00:09:18,875
You can't play games during game time,

170
00:09:18,875 --> 00:09:19,948
and be realistic when it's reality.

171
00:09:19,948 --> 00:09:21,125
Sorry, I'm so sorry.

172
00:09:21,125 --> 00:09:23,583
I'm sorry, Mr. Li. I'm late.

173
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:27,541
Mr. Lu, have a seat.

174
00:09:27,541 --> 00:09:30,250
I'm sure your brother
won't ruin things for you.

175
00:09:30,250 --> 00:09:31,375
Of course, of course.

176
00:09:31,375 --> 00:09:33,541
We're just making a fortune together.

177
00:09:33,541 --> 00:09:35,266
Making a fortune together.

178
00:09:36,125 --> 00:09:39,916
Don't worry, I won't
do anything to Bei Lv Qing.

179
00:09:39,916 --> 00:09:41,041
Business is business.

180
00:09:41,041 --> 00:09:42,541
I'm not that naive.

181
00:09:42,541 --> 00:09:44,583
Yes, I know that, of course.

182
00:09:44,583 --> 00:09:46,375
I'm just worried about my brother.

183
00:09:46,375 --> 00:09:47,791
Him?

184
00:09:47,791 --> 00:09:49,208
He's a bit slow.

185
00:09:49,208 --> 00:09:51,020
He might get the wrong idea.

186
00:09:54,333 --> 00:09:55,853
Xiao Fan.

187
00:09:57,000 --> 00:10:00,542
I'm not asking you to do anything difficult.

188
00:10:00,542 --> 00:10:03,610
Just tell me Bei Lv Qing's
position information.

189
00:10:13,500 --> 00:10:14,625
I promised you.

190
00:10:14,625 --> 00:10:18,333
This is a 200,000-yuan cashier's check.
You can cash it at any time.

191
00:10:18,958 --> 00:10:21,012
Of course, I trust you, Mr. Li.

192
00:10:21,012 --> 00:10:24,125
You're such a big boss.
Why wouldn't I trust you?

193
00:10:26,125 --> 00:10:27,625
Wen Xi.

194
00:10:28,333 --> 00:10:30,375
If you want to open positions
alongside Big Bro Bei,

195
00:10:30,375 --> 00:10:32,309
you can work with him directly.

196
00:10:32,309 --> 00:10:33,375
I mean it.

197
00:10:33,375 --> 00:10:35,541
- My brother is unreliable.
- Are you kidding me?

198
00:10:35,541 --> 00:10:38,083
Is Bei Lv Qing your brother,
or am I your brother?

199
00:10:39,333 --> 00:10:41,250
In comparison,

200
00:10:41,250 --> 00:10:44,916
I still trust information
bought with cold, hard cash.

201
00:10:44,916 --> 00:10:46,083
For the family's benefit,

202
00:10:46,083 --> 00:10:48,583
it's not convenient for me
to owe Bei Lv Qing too many favors.

203
00:10:48,583 --> 00:10:49,750
Business is business.

204
00:10:49,750 --> 00:10:51,333
That would be so inconvenient.

205
00:10:51,333 --> 00:10:54,333
That's true,
matters between big bosses like you...

206
00:10:54,333 --> 00:10:56,916
Just one look at them
is worth ten years of your studies.

207
00:10:58,250 --> 00:11:02,041
Xiao Fan, you're still
living at Bei Lv Qing's place.

208
00:11:02,041 --> 00:11:04,500
If you can provide me with more of his intel...

209
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:07,548
- Even if things don't work out...
- I never get involved in these things.

210
00:11:10,250 --> 00:11:11,833
400,000.

211
00:11:11,833 --> 00:11:13,916
Mr. Li, you're so generous.

212
00:11:13,916 --> 00:11:15,166
Don't worry, Mr. Li.

213
00:11:15,166 --> 00:11:17,583
I'll work on Xiao Fan's task.

214
00:11:22,916 --> 00:11:24,958
Maybe the next time we meet,

215
00:11:24,958 --> 00:11:28,041
I'll be establishing a partnership with you.

216
00:11:29,125 --> 00:11:32,125
Today, I'm happy to treat you all to coffee.

217
00:11:32,125 --> 00:11:34,513
- I'll be going now.
- Wen Xi.

218
00:11:35,458 --> 00:11:38,083
You're doing this right in front of me.

219
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,500
Aren't you afraid I'll tell Bei Lv Qing?

220
00:11:43,625 --> 00:11:45,875
Xiao Fan, you're a smart man.

221
00:11:45,875 --> 00:11:47,041
What you want,

222
00:11:47,041 --> 00:11:49,208
Bei Lv Qing might not be able to give you.

223
00:11:49,208 --> 00:11:52,291
Just like back then,
he couldn't give it to me either.

224
00:11:53,083 --> 00:11:55,749
Maybe this 400,000 isn't what you want,

225
00:11:55,749 --> 00:11:59,499
but this is something
you can hold firmly in your own hands.

226
00:12:16,332 --> 00:12:18,708
<i>Xiao Fan, did you stop your brother?</i>

227
00:12:18,708 --> 00:12:21,416
I've been at the door,
but he refuses to come out and see me.

228
00:12:21,416 --> 00:12:24,166
<i>Your dad gave Xiao Ping all the money
he collected from the whole village.</i>

229
00:12:24,166 --> 00:12:26,458
<i>Even Old Lady Liu
brought out her funeral savings.</i>

230
00:12:26,458 --> 00:12:27,791
<i>They're all counting on Xiao Ping</i>

231
00:12:27,791 --> 00:12:29,333
<i>to lead them to a fortune.</i>

232
00:12:29,333 --> 00:12:30,940
<i>I can't stop them either.</i>

233
00:12:30,940 --> 00:12:32,458
<i>Why are you crying?</i>

234
00:12:32,458 --> 00:12:34,874
<i>This is their trust in us.</i>

235
00:12:34,874 --> 00:12:36,374
<i>He's going to help us make money.</i>

236
00:12:36,374 --> 00:12:40,500
<i>- Xiao Fan.</i>
- Mom, what can I do?

237
00:12:40,500 --> 00:12:42,958
<i>I know they're being unreasonable.</i>

238
00:12:42,958 --> 00:12:47,539
<i>But if I don't beg you, what else can I do?</i>

239
00:13:10,958 --> 00:13:12,499
Be careful.

240
00:13:42,292 --> 00:13:45,083
Big Bro, are you still busy?

241
00:13:45,083 --> 00:13:46,667
Have you been drinking?

242
00:13:46,667 --> 00:13:48,499
Do you want me to pick you up?

243
00:13:48,499 --> 00:13:52,791
<i>Lv Qing, who is it at this hour?</i>

244
00:13:52,791 --> 00:13:54,214
Tomorrow morning...

245
00:13:56,167 --> 00:13:58,042
Will you come back for porridge?

246
00:14:43,416 --> 00:14:44,980
Big Bro?

247
00:14:46,167 --> 00:14:47,511
And you are?

248
00:14:47,511 --> 00:14:49,833
You must be Mr. Lu Xiao Fan.

249
00:14:49,833 --> 00:14:52,042
I'm here to clean.

250
00:14:52,042 --> 00:14:53,083
Hello, hello.

251
00:14:53,083 --> 00:14:54,667
Oh, please don't.

252
00:14:54,667 --> 00:14:56,999
Mr. Bei specifically arranged for me.

253
00:14:56,999 --> 00:14:58,624
Sorry to disturb you so early.

254
00:14:58,624 --> 00:15:00,592
You can go back to sleep.

255
00:15:07,750 --> 00:15:10,231
Ma'am, let me help you.

256
00:15:10,917 --> 00:15:13,333
Mr. Lu, you don't have to do this.

257
00:15:13,333 --> 00:15:15,749
I've always done the cleaning for Mr. Bei.

258
00:15:15,749 --> 00:15:18,374
I know his habits and requirements.

259
00:15:21,500 --> 00:15:23,374
Bei Lv Qing...

260
00:15:23,374 --> 00:15:24,705
Mr. Bei...

261
00:15:24,705 --> 00:15:26,292
Since he moved to Lin Gang,

262
00:15:26,292 --> 00:15:28,458
you've been doing the cleaning?

263
00:15:28,458 --> 00:15:29,750
Of course.

264
00:15:29,750 --> 00:15:32,791
Otherwise, why would he
invite me all the way from Yunjing?

265
00:15:32,791 --> 00:15:34,291
I'm not bragging,

266
00:15:34,291 --> 00:15:37,416
but it's hard to find a cleaner
as meticulous as me these days.

267
00:15:37,416 --> 00:15:40,208
In a client's home,
I know exactly what is kept where.

268
00:15:40,208 --> 00:15:41,875
I remember it after seeing it once.

269
00:15:41,875 --> 00:15:43,958
I'll never misplace anything.

270
00:15:43,958 --> 00:15:45,791
Unlike some cleaners nowadays,

271
00:15:45,791 --> 00:15:46,874
who go to someone's house

272
00:15:46,874 --> 00:15:48,499
and rearrange things so much

273
00:15:48,499 --> 00:15:50,666
that the owner can't find anything.

274
00:15:50,666 --> 00:15:52,749
So, you're the one

275
00:15:52,749 --> 00:15:54,124
who organizes everything in the house?

276
00:15:54,124 --> 00:15:55,993
Of course.

277
00:15:57,625 --> 00:15:59,209
I see.

278
00:16:17,249 --> 00:16:19,333
Big Bro, you're back.

279
00:16:19,333 --> 00:16:21,602
Two more dishes and it's ready.

280
00:16:27,791 --> 00:16:29,583
Lu Xiao Fan.

281
00:16:29,583 --> 00:16:31,366
You're doing it on purpose, aren't you?

282
00:16:33,166 --> 00:16:34,570
This...

283
00:16:35,208 --> 00:16:37,916
I bought this at the supermarket today.

284
00:16:37,916 --> 00:16:40,041
I thought it was cute, so I brought it back.

285
00:16:40,041 --> 00:16:41,863
Doesn't it look good?

286
00:16:42,875 --> 00:16:44,291
Big Bro, just wait a little longer.

287
00:16:44,291 --> 00:16:45,990
The food will be ready soon.

288
00:17:11,250 --> 00:17:12,291
Big Bro.

289
00:17:12,291 --> 00:17:14,043
It's so late. Why aren't you asleep yet?

290
00:17:15,458 --> 00:17:17,541
I didn't know when you'd be back.

291
00:17:17,541 --> 00:17:19,623
I just wanted to wait a bit longer.

292
00:17:22,403 --> 00:17:23,667
Big Bro.

293
00:17:23,667 --> 00:17:25,652
What have you been busy with lately?

294
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,250
Xiao Fan.

295
00:17:31,250 --> 00:17:33,333
I might have to go back to Yunjing.

296
00:17:33,333 --> 00:17:35,500
I'll be back after the New Year.

297
00:17:37,958 --> 00:17:41,333
Don't go anywhere during this time.

298
00:17:44,667 --> 00:17:46,167
Okay?

299
00:17:47,111 --> 00:17:48,506
Okay.

300
00:18:17,917 --> 00:18:20,208
- Big Bro...
<i>- Hey, Lu Xiao Fan.</i>

301
00:18:20,208 --> 00:18:24,042
<i>This world is a place for bastards.</i>

302
00:18:24,042 --> 00:18:26,750
Bei Lv Xin? Where are you right now?

303
00:18:26,750 --> 00:18:28,041
<i>Huh?</i>

304
00:18:28,041 --> 00:18:30,125
<i>I don't know where I am.</i>

305
00:18:30,125 --> 00:18:31,708
<i>It's so high up here.</i>

306
00:18:31,708 --> 00:18:33,166
<i>Lu Xiao Fan.</i>

307
00:18:33,166 --> 00:18:35,166
<i>- The people below look so small.</i>
- Bei Lv Xin!

308
00:18:35,166 --> 00:18:36,166
Don't do anything rash.

309
00:18:36,166 --> 00:18:38,000
I'm coming over right now.

310
00:18:48,583 --> 00:18:49,916
Lv Xin!

311
00:18:50,708 --> 00:18:52,041
Lv Xin!

312
00:18:57,791 --> 00:18:59,250
Lv Xin!

313
00:18:59,250 --> 00:19:00,583
- Lv Xin!
- Don't.

314
00:19:01,458 --> 00:19:03,375
- Lv Xin!
- Don't come over here!

315
00:19:04,041 --> 00:19:06,458
Lv Xin, come down first, okay?

316
00:19:06,458 --> 00:19:07,500
Lv Xin.

317
00:19:07,500 --> 00:19:08,708
Don't be impulsive.

318
00:19:08,708 --> 00:19:10,520
Don't come any closer!

319
00:19:19,250 --> 00:19:21,000
Lu Xiao Fan.

320
00:19:22,750 --> 00:19:26,435
Why am I so unlucky?

321
00:19:31,875 --> 00:19:35,510
Our fathers aren't even the same.

322
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:41,892
Why couldn't our mothers be different too?

323
00:19:42,791 --> 00:19:44,333
Why?

324
00:19:44,333 --> 00:19:47,208
Why!

325
00:19:50,375 --> 00:19:51,666
Lv Xin.

326
00:19:52,875 --> 00:19:54,541
Xiao Fan.

327
00:20:00,208 --> 00:20:01,916
Song Qian Yu.

328
00:20:01,916 --> 00:20:04,541
Do you think she's good?

329
00:20:04,541 --> 00:20:06,333
What's so good about her?

330
00:20:06,333 --> 00:20:08,625
What's so great about her?

331
00:20:08,625 --> 00:20:10,577
Song Qian Yu...

332
00:20:21,625 --> 00:20:25,046
He finally admitted it today.

333
00:20:27,250 --> 00:20:30,515
He said he has someone he likes.

334
00:20:32,375 --> 00:20:34,666
The one my mom introduced to him.

335
00:20:36,625 --> 00:20:38,875
Song Qian Yu.

336
00:20:38,875 --> 00:20:40,974
Song Qian Yu.

337
00:20:40,974 --> 00:20:43,029
Song Qian Yu!

338
00:20:57,750 --> 00:20:59,083
Lu Xiao Fan.

339
00:21:03,250 --> 00:21:05,750
Am I really that pathetic?

340
00:21:06,667 --> 00:21:08,591
No.

341
00:21:08,591 --> 00:21:10,842
I don't think so.

342
00:21:10,842 --> 00:21:13,208
Let's go home first, okay?

343
00:21:13,208 --> 00:21:14,560
Go home...

344
00:21:15,917 --> 00:21:17,291
Let's go home first.

345
00:21:17,291 --> 00:21:20,250
He has someone he likes.

346
00:21:20,250 --> 00:21:22,958
He has someone he likes...

347
00:21:24,182 --> 00:21:26,042
Is anyone home?

348
00:21:26,042 --> 00:21:27,499
My dad...

349
00:21:27,499 --> 00:21:30,540
He went to eat with the guards.

350
00:21:30,540 --> 00:21:32,165
My brother...

351
00:21:32,165 --> 00:21:35,148
He went to the restaurant my mom booked.

352
00:21:35,148 --> 00:21:37,792
- Careful.
- And that vixen...

353
00:21:37,792 --> 00:21:39,957
Song Qian Yu.

354
00:21:39,957 --> 00:21:41,458
Song Qian Yu!

355
00:21:41,458 --> 00:21:43,118
Careful now.

356
00:21:46,469 --> 00:21:47,802
Xiao Fan.

357
00:21:48,720 --> 00:21:50,457
Xiao Fan.

358
00:21:50,457 --> 00:21:51,957
Lv Xin.

359
00:21:51,957 --> 00:21:53,040
You should get some rest.

360
00:21:53,040 --> 00:21:55,207
- Rest first.
- Xiao Fan.

361
00:21:55,207 --> 00:21:56,957
Don't leave.

362
00:21:56,957 --> 00:21:58,249
Xiao Fan.

363
00:21:58,249 --> 00:22:00,056
Xiao Fan.

364
00:22:03,082 --> 00:22:04,290
Xiao Fan.

365
00:22:04,290 --> 00:22:05,957
Xiao Fan.

366
00:22:05,957 --> 00:22:08,959
Let's live as a real couple, okay?

367
00:22:09,931 --> 00:22:11,598
Xiao Fan.

368
00:22:12,457 --> 00:22:13,540
Lv Xin.

369
00:22:13,540 --> 00:22:16,040
- Lv Xin, don't do this.
- Lu Xiao Fan.

370
00:22:22,540 --> 00:22:25,540
I thought you'd never leave me.

371
00:22:30,582 --> 00:22:32,207
You've had too much to drink.

372
00:22:32,207 --> 00:22:33,749
Get some rest first.

373
00:22:41,500 --> 00:22:43,167
Lu Xiao Fan.

374
00:22:46,124 --> 00:22:48,999
It's actually fine if we just make do.

375
00:23:03,792 --> 00:23:06,833
I've actually never looked down on you.

376
00:23:10,707 --> 00:23:12,665
On the contrary, I was very worried.

377
00:23:15,292 --> 00:23:17,959
I was worried that I'd be looked down on.

378
00:23:27,540 --> 00:23:30,249
I felt that only by
constantly belittling you...

379
00:23:34,125 --> 00:23:36,792
could I feel like I wasn't that bad.

380
00:23:38,875 --> 00:23:40,417
I'm sorry.

381
00:23:41,955 --> 00:23:43,955
I'm sorry.

382
00:23:57,915 --> 00:24:01,290
Lv Xin, would you like some soy milk?

383
00:24:06,708 --> 00:24:07,840
Should I hide?

384
00:24:07,840 --> 00:24:09,298
Lv Xin?

385
00:24:10,290 --> 00:24:11,624
No need.

386
00:24:12,415 --> 00:24:13,915
Coming.

387
00:24:18,542 --> 00:24:19,707
Lv Xin, I'll go pour some more.

388
00:24:19,707 --> 00:24:20,874
Everyone...

389
00:24:21,624 --> 00:24:23,104
Auntie Lin.

390
00:24:31,917 --> 00:24:33,513
Xiao Fan, you're back.

391
00:24:33,513 --> 00:24:36,415
Go down and eat. Everyone's there.

392
00:24:44,667 --> 00:24:45,799
Fan Fan is back.

393
00:24:45,799 --> 00:24:47,153
Come, have a seat.

394
00:24:49,707 --> 00:24:51,957
It's good to have you back.

395
00:24:51,957 --> 00:24:53,165
You've really lost a lot of weight.

396
00:24:53,165 --> 00:24:55,498
You can't eat as well out there
as you do at home.

397
00:25:05,333 --> 00:25:07,123
Mister...

398
00:25:07,123 --> 00:25:08,447
Uncle Bei.

399
00:25:09,582 --> 00:25:11,248
I still have to go back to Lin Gang.

400
00:25:11,248 --> 00:25:12,952
I'll take my leave now.

401
00:25:13,790 --> 00:25:16,488
Do you have urgent business in Lin Gang?

402
00:25:17,748 --> 00:25:19,082
No.

403
00:25:20,708 --> 00:25:23,750
It's just not very convenient
for me to stay here.

404
00:25:26,623 --> 00:25:28,157
Not convenient?

405
00:25:29,623 --> 00:25:32,612
Xiao Fan, what exactly do you mean by that?

406
00:25:40,958 --> 00:25:44,337
Am I not in the middle of
getting a divorce from Lv Xin?

407
00:25:57,000 --> 00:25:59,041
I'll walk you out, Xiao Fan.

408
00:26:07,083 --> 00:26:08,708
Let's go, Xiao Fan.

409
00:26:11,750 --> 00:26:13,083
Xiao Fan.

410
00:26:16,750 --> 00:26:19,592
Lu Xiao Fan, you jerk!

411
00:26:24,873 --> 00:26:26,279
That's enough.

412
00:26:27,082 --> 00:26:30,613
Auntie Lin, go get a towel
to wipe Xiao Fan down.

413
00:26:36,292 --> 00:26:40,539
It's normal for young people
to have some conflicts.

414
00:26:43,623 --> 00:26:48,013
But to demand a divorce
over such a small disagreement?

415
00:26:49,707 --> 00:26:53,522
What regard do you have
for marriage and family?

416
00:27:00,998 --> 00:27:04,290
Regarding this matter,
I will speak with your mother.

417
00:27:04,290 --> 00:27:07,008
You should reflect on yourself as well.

418
00:27:13,208 --> 00:27:14,458
Yes.

419
00:28:04,083 --> 00:28:05,499
<i>Let's go.</i>

420
00:28:09,415 --> 00:28:13,052
- I only came back because...
- If Bei Lv Xin doesn't want a divorce...

421
00:28:14,123 --> 00:28:15,707
What do you plan to do?

422
00:28:17,625 --> 00:28:19,588
What else can I do?

423
00:28:21,248 --> 00:28:23,248
Then don't mention the divorce.

424
00:28:24,123 --> 00:28:25,875
Just wait a while.

425
00:28:25,875 --> 00:28:27,542
Understand?

426
00:28:29,344 --> 00:28:31,011
I understand.

427
00:28:42,542 --> 00:28:44,546
Oh, you...

428
00:29:08,873 --> 00:29:10,167
<i>Lu Xiao Fan.</i>

429
00:29:10,167 --> 00:29:13,332
<i>What on earth is wrong with you?</i>

430
00:29:13,332 --> 00:29:17,000
<i>You made Mr. Bei so angry,
he even scolded our mother.</i>

431
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:18,679
<i>Do you know that because of you,</i>

432
00:29:18,679 --> 00:29:21,248
<i>Dad's blood pressure spiked
and he's lying at home with a headache?</i>

433
00:29:21,248 --> 00:29:23,165
<i>Lu Xiao Fan, it's fine if you're alone,</i>

434
00:29:23,165 --> 00:29:24,415
<i>but don't drag the family down.</i>

435
00:29:24,415 --> 00:29:26,019
<i>Do you understand?</i>

436
00:29:29,626 --> 00:29:30,915
<i>Mom and Dad are coming here</i>

437
00:29:30,915 --> 00:29:33,332
<i>to personally settle the conflict
between our family and the Beis.</i>

438
00:29:33,332 --> 00:29:34,873
<i>Don't be so thick-headed when they arrive.</i>

439
00:29:34,873 --> 00:29:36,207
<i>Got it?</i>

440
00:29:36,207 --> 00:29:39,415
<i>Of course, it's not like
we have to rely on the Beis.</i>

441
00:29:39,415 --> 00:29:41,665
<i>But in this world, it's about ability.</i>

442
00:29:41,665 --> 00:29:43,165
<i>Some people rely on ability,</i>

443
00:29:43,165 --> 00:29:44,665
<i>others rely on connections.</i>

444
00:29:44,665 --> 00:29:45,792
<i>That's life.</i>

445
00:29:45,792 --> 00:29:47,167
<i>Understand?</i>

446
00:29:47,167 --> 00:29:49,577
<i>All right, reflect on yourself first.</i>

447
00:30:08,415 --> 00:30:09,832
Go to bed.

448
00:30:09,832 --> 00:30:11,623
I'm not done yet.

449
00:30:13,832 --> 00:30:17,125
I heard the Lu family is all coming out again.

450
00:30:17,125 --> 00:30:18,748
Yes.

451
00:30:18,748 --> 00:30:20,290
They've already bought the tickets.

452
00:30:20,290 --> 00:30:21,884
They'll arrive tomorrow.

453
00:30:22,915 --> 00:30:24,707
I have things to do tomorrow.

454
00:30:24,707 --> 00:30:27,728
You'll have to deal with them yourself.

455
00:30:27,728 --> 00:30:29,582
Don't worry, Big Bro.

456
00:30:30,366 --> 00:30:32,228
It's not the first time.

457
00:30:41,417 --> 00:30:45,548
Just for the sake of your parents,
stop making a scene.

458
00:30:47,310 --> 00:30:48,570
Okay.

459
00:30:53,457 --> 00:30:54,915
<i>Some people rely on ability,</i>

460
00:30:54,915 --> 00:30:56,457
<i>others rely on connections.</i>

461
00:30:56,457 --> 00:30:59,042
<i>That's life. Understand?</i>

462
00:30:59,042 --> 00:31:01,458
<i>All right, reflect on yourself first.</i>

463
00:31:02,582 --> 00:31:04,667
Are you finished?

464
00:31:04,667 --> 00:31:06,641
I have something to tell you.

465
00:31:22,750 --> 00:31:25,773
Big Bro, have some fruit.

466
00:32:15,458 --> 00:32:17,417
Lu Xiao Fan.

467
00:32:17,417 --> 00:32:19,604
You're doing this on purpose, aren't you?

